          "_id": "64d7d640d5f398128fd6c84e",
          "Entry_Title": "Feriado de agosto: Plottier Rock Festival trae bandas nacionales convocantes con entrada libre y gratuita",
          "Entry_Resume": "El próximo fin de semana largo de agosto estará cargado de música con el Plottier Rock Festival. Serán 3 noches con 4 artistas nacionales en el predio de la Expo con entrada libre y gratuita.",
          "Entry_Body": "\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003EEl evento es organizado por la Municipalidad de Plottier, y el predio estará todas las fechas con las puertas abiertas desde las 17 horas.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003ESegún detalló&nbsp;\u003Cem style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003EAlto Valle Night,&nbsp;\u003C/em\u003Eel evento se realizará del&nbsp;sábado&nbsp;19 de agosto y durará hasta el lunes. Si bien el 17 de agosto de agosto se cumple otro nuevo aniversario del&nbsp;paso a la inmortalidad del General José de San Martín,&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https://www.mejorinformado.com/temas/feriados-1674.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 109, 214); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;\"\u003Eeste&nbsp;feriado&nbsp;fue corrido para el&nbsp;lunes 21 de agosto\u003C/a\u003E.\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7a/1.5/16/1f3b8.png\" alt=\"🎸\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7a/1.5/16/1f3b8.png\" alt=\"🎸\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"\u003E&nbsp;Sábado 19 – Los Tipitos\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7a/1.5/16/1f3b8.png\" alt=\"🎸\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"\u003EDomingo 20 – Viejas Locas\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7a/1.5/16/1f3b8.png\" alt=\"🎸\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"\u003E&nbsp;Lunes 21 – El Mató Un Policía Motorizado, y FMK\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7a/1.5/16/1f3b8.png\" alt=\"🎸\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"\u003E&nbsp;Mas bandas invitadas todos los días.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t86/1.5/16/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"📍\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"\u003E&nbsp;Ex Predio Expo Plottier – (Predio Domingo «Chumingo» Quiroz)\u003C/p\u003E",
