          "Entry_Title": "Hoy continúa la Regata de la Confluencia",
          "Entry_Resume": "Esta edición de la Regata de la Confluencia convocó a más de 300 palistas. La etapa 1 largó a las 15, desde la calle Figueroa y Costanera hasta el balneario Albino Cotro y hoy continúa por la mañana la segunda etapa a las 10 -competitiva y contrareloj- desde y hasta el balneario Valentina por la mañana.",
          "Entry_Body": "\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003ELa etapa 3 -recreativa y competitiva- tiene su punto de inicio en el balneario Valentina Sur a las 15, con llegada a Albino Cotro. En la categoría Dupla Travesía mixtos master A, resultaron primeros Juan Pablo Radys y María Eugenia Catalano, y en segundo lugar, Inés Carrasco y Francisco Rimada. En la categoría Master B, primeros Gustavo Ruiz y Fabiola Platero, y segunda ubicación para los palistas Roberto Samar y y María Josefina Valls.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003ETabla de resultados completos Etapa I de ayer:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-02-at-21.23.42.jpeg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 128, 128); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;\"\u003E\u003Cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5968\" src=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-02-at-21.23.42.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"718\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-02-at-21.23.42.jpeg 718w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-02-at-21.23.42-300x208.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 718px) 100vw, 718px\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: auto;\"\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: &quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmTvRWQAAVnXO.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 128, 128); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;\"\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5969\" src=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmTvRWQAAVnXO.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"791\" srcset=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmTvRWQAAVnXO.jpg 819w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmTvRWQAAVnXO-240x300.jpg 240w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmTvRWQAAVnXO-768x960.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 633px) 100vw, 633px\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: auto;\"\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E&nbsp;\u003C/span\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 128, 128); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;\"\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5970\" src=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"524\" height=\"786\" srcset=\"https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W-200x300.jpg 200w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://contactonqn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GAXmUEjXAAAXo_W.jpg 1387w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 524px) 100vw, 524px\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: auto;\"\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
